    in Hell, my dear!\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"???\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":3}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":455.5,\"yPos\":-2318},\"ID\":2,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Gah
    !! Who are you?!\",\"parentUIDs\":[1],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":4}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":451.5,\"yPos\":-2193},\"ID\":3,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    The Devil's Advocate, welcome to Hell, Helena.\",\"parentUIDs\":[2],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":5}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":454.5,\"yPos\":-2066},\"ID\":4,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    in...\",\"parentUIDs\":[3],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":6}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":456.5,\"yPos\":-1941},\"ID\":5,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"..
    WHAT??!\",\"parentUIDs\":[4],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":7}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":456.5,\"yPos\":-1811},\"ID\":6,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Hell!
    It's quite marvellous, no?\",\"parentUIDs\":[5],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":8}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":455.5,\"yPos\":-1686},\"ID\":7,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Marve-wha-NO!\",\"parentUIDs\":[6],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":9}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":458.5,\"yPos\":-1556},\"ID\":8,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I
    need to leave, I have to get back to the surface.\",\"parentUIDs\":[7],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":10}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":453.5,\"yPos\":-1429},\"ID\":9,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Why
    would you ever want to leave?\",\"parentUIDs\":[8],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":11}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":448.5,\"yPos\":-1309},\"ID\":10,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"You\u2019ve
    made quite the name for yourself, you know. So many souls have eagerly awaited
    your demise.\",\"parentUIDs\":[9],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":12}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":446.5,\"yPos\":-1182},\"ID\":11,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"But...
    Judith... I have to get back to Judith.\",\"parentUIDs\":[10],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":13}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":446.5,\"yPos\":-1061},\"ID\":12,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I\u2019m
    afraid I cannot allow that to happen, dear. Your corrupt soul now belongs to
    Hell, there\u2019s no escaping such a fate.\",\"parentUIDs\":[11],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":14}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":448.5,\"yPos\":-933},\"ID\":13,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"No\u2026
    I can\u2019t-I won\u2019t allow it!\",\"parentUIDs\":[12],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":15}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":452.5,\"yPos\":-806},\"ID\":14,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Judith...\",\"parentUIDs\":[13],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":16}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":453.5,\"yPos\":-678},\"ID\":15,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"JUDITH
    CAN'T GET AWAY WITH THIS!\",\"parentUIDs\":[14],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":17}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":443.5,\"yPos\":-550},\"ID\":16,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I\u2019M
    GONNA GET HER AND TAKE HER DOWN WITH ME.\",\"parentUIDs\":[15],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":18}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":449.5,\"yPos\":-418},\"ID\":17,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"!\",\"parentUIDs\":[16],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":19}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":449.5,\"yPos\":-283},\"ID\":18,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Oh
    my, how devilish!\",\"parentUIDs\":[17],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":20}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":451.5,\"yPos\":-147},\"ID\":19,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Hm\u2026
    I suppose there may be one way\u2026\",\"parentUIDs\":[18],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":453.5,\"yPos\":-16},\"ID\":20,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"There
    is? Tell me, please!\",\"parentUIDs\":[19],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Helena\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":22}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":450.5,\"yPos\":127},\"ID\":21,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Well\u2026
    to get there, you will need a weapon.\",\"parentUIDs\":[20],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"The
    Devil's Advocate\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":23}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":449.5,\"yPos\":261},\"ID\":22,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
